WEBVTT

00:09:00.386 --> 00:09:02.600
And it generates the empathy that we need

00:09:02.600 --> 00:09:06.026
to overcome all the ways
that we try to hurt one another.

00:09:06.026 --> 00:09:11.577
Stigma, shame, prejudice, 
discrimination, oppression.

00:09:12.690 --> 00:09:17.570
Pro-voice is contagious,
and the more it's practiced

00:09:17.603 --> 00:09:19.193
the more it spreads.

00:09:23.149 --> 00:09:25.903
So, last year I was pregnant again.

00:09:26.253 --> 00:09:29.549
This time I was looking forward 
to the birth of my son.